    <bpmn:process id="W_W1624" name="W1624. Customer Exchange Processing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer requests exchange (different size, color, or item) instead of refund
Frequency: ~15,000 exchanges/month (~27% of returns result in exchange)
Volume: ~75 exchanges/store/month
Owner: CSR
Participants: CSR, Customer Service Manager
Source: workflow W1624 — Customer Exchange Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1624_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1624_Lane1" name="CSR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1624_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1624_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1624_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1624_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1624_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1624_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1624_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1624_Start4" name="Customer requests exchange (different size, color, or item) instead of refund">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1624_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1624_Task5" name="Customer requests exchange during return process (W1622 step 4); selects…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer requests exchange during return process (W1622 step 4); selects replacement item — same SKU different variant (size, color) or different SKU within same category
Responsible (R): CSR
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1624_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1624_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1624_Task6" name="System checks: (a) requested exchange item availability at current store, (b)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System checks: (a) requested exchange item availability at current store, (b) if not available at current store: checks nearby stores (within 30 km) or offers home delivery from DC, (c) price difference calculation: (i) same price item — even exchange, (ii) higher price item — customer pays difference, (iii) lower price item — customer receives store credit for difference (no cash refund on exchange)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1624_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1624_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1624_Task7" name="CSR processes exchange: (a) scans returned item (return transaction), (b) scans…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CSR processes exchange: (a) scans returned item (return transaction), (b) scans new item (sale transaction), (c) system creates linked exchange transaction (return + sale), (d) price difference collected or store credit issued
Responsible (R): CSR
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 3 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1624_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1624_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1624_Task8" name="Inventory: returned item added back to stock; exchanged item deducted from…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Inventory: returned item added back to stock; exchanged item deducted from stock; net inventory impact is zero if same SKU variant, or one SKU increase / one SKU decrease
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1624_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1624_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1624_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1624_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1624_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-337 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Returns Processing (PA-32.1).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: CSR</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1624_Assoc11" sourceRef="W1624_Annotation10" targetRef="W1624_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
