    <bpmn:process id="W_W1627" name="W1627. Customer Return Credit Issuance &amp; Refund Processing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Return transaction completed (W1622, W1623, or W1625)
Frequency: ~41,000 refund transactions/month (56,000 returns less ~15,000 exchanges per W1624)
Volume: ~205 per store/month (41,000 refund transactions/month ÷ 200 stores; the ~280/store figure is the all-returns W1622 canon)
Owner: CSR (processing); Finance (reconciliation)
Participants: CSR, Customer Service Manager, AP/AR Clerk, Controller
Source: workflow W1627 — Customer Return Credit Issuance &amp; Refund Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1627_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1627_Lane1" name="CSR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1627_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1627_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1627_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1627_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1627_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1627_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1627_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1627_Lane3" name="AP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1627_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1627_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1627_Start5" name="Return transaction completed (W1622, W1623, or W1625)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1627_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1627_Task6" name="Refund method determined per return type: (a) with receipt — original tender…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Refund method determined per return type: (a) with receipt — original tender method, (b) without receipt — store credit only, (c) exchange — no refund (credit applied to exchange), (d) ecommerce — per W1623.7 (card/e-wallet/bank transfer), (e) B2B credit note — per W1629
Responsible (R): CSR / System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1627_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1627_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1627_Task7" name="Cash refund: CSR opens cash drawer; dispenses cash per return receipt amount…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Cash refund: CSR opens cash drawer; dispenses cash per return receipt amount; cash count updated in system; included in daily cash reconciliation per W5F
Responsible (R): CSR
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1627_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1627_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1627_Task8" name="Card refund: system initiates refund to original card; transaction posts in 3–5…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Card refund: system initiates refund to original card; transaction posts in 3–5 business days; CSR gives customer card refund receipt; no cash handling required
Responsible (R): System / CSR
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1627_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1627_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1627_Task9" name="Store credit: system issues store credit (gift card or digital credit to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Store credit: system issues store credit (gift card or digital credit to loyalty account); credit amount = return value; credit expires 12 months from issuance; BIR-compliant receipt generated
Responsible (R): System / CSR
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1627_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1627_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1627_Task10" name="B2B credit note: system generates credit note against trade/corporate account…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: B2B credit note: system generates credit note against trade/corporate account; credit applied to AR balance; no cash outflow; per W1629
Responsible (R): System / AR Clerk
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1627_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1627_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1627_Task11" name="Daily: Finance reconciles return refunds — total refunds by type (cash, card…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Daily: Finance reconciles return refunds — total refunds by type (cash, card, store credit, credit note) against return transactions posted; flags discrepancies for investigation
Responsible (R): AP/AR Clerk
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 30 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1627_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1627_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1627_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1627_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1627_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-179 (ensure returns integrity &amp; refund-fraud prevention.) | - operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: CSR (processing); Finance (reconciliation)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
